<%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>

    <div class="about">
        <h2>About This Blog</h2>

        <p>
            This blog is a simple game review platform that covers various game genres,
            including Action, RPG, and Indie titles. Each review is written based on
            personal gameplay experience, with the goal of providing honest and
            straightforward impressions of each game.
        </p>

        <p>
            Users can read, create, edit, and delete game reviews through this blog.
            This project was developed as part of a Web Development capstone project
            and serves as hands-on practice in building a CRUD-based web application
            using Express and EJS.
        </p>

        <p>
            This blog aims to be a simple reference for gamers who want quick insights
            before deciding to try a game themselves.
        </p>
    </div>

